{"ch": 80, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "عَبَسَ وَتَوَلّٰۤی ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "He frowned and turned aside,", "w": ["he frowned", "and turned aside", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "اَنۡ جَآءَہُ الۡاَعۡمٰی ؕ﴿۳﴾", "en": "Because there came to him the blind man.", "w": ["because", "there came to him", "the blind man", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "وَمَا یُدۡرِیۡکَ لَعَلَّہٗ یَزَّکّٰۤی ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "And what makes thee know that he may be seeking to purify himself,", "w": ["and what", "makes thee know", "that he may be", "seeking to purify himself", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "اَوۡ یَذَّکَّرُ فَتَنۡفَعَہُ الذِّکۡرٰی ؕ﴿۵﴾", "en": "Or he may take heed and the Reminder may benefit him?", "w": ["or", "he may take heed", "and may benefit him", "the Reminder", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "اَمَّا مَنِ اسۡتَغۡنٰی ۙ﴿۶﴾", "en": "As for him who is disdainfully indifferent.", "w": ["as for", "him who is", "disdainfully indifferent", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "فَاَنۡتَ لَہٗ تَصَدّٰی ؕ﴿۷﴾", "en": "Unto him thou dost pay attention,", "w": ["thou dost", "unto him", "pay attention", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "وَمَا عَلَیۡکَ اَلَّا یَزَّکّٰی ؕ﴿۸﴾", "en": "Though thou art not responsible if he does not become purified.", "w": ["though not", "thou art responsible", "if not", "he does become purified", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وَاَمَّا مَنۡ جَآءَکَ یَسۡعٰی ۙ﴿۹﴾", "en": "But he who comes to thee hastening,", "w": ["but", "he who", "comes to thee", "hastening", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "وَہُوَ یَخۡشٰی ۙ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "And he fears <i>God</i>,", "w": ["and he", "fears <i>God</i>", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "فَاَنۡتَ عَنۡہُ تَلَہّٰی ﴿ۚ۱۱﴾", "en": "Him dost thou neglect.", "w": ["dost thou", "Him", "neglect", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "کَلَّاۤ اِنَّہَا تَذۡکِرَۃٌ ﴿ۚ۱۲﴾", "en": "Nay! surely it is a Reminder —", "w": ["nay", "surely it is", "a Reminder", ""]}, {"n": 13, "ar": "فَمَنۡ شَآءَ ذَکَرَہٗ ﴿ۘ۱۳﴾", "en": "So let him who desires pay heed to it —", "w": ["so let him who", "desires", "pay heed to it", ""]}, {"n": 14, "ar": "فِیۡ صُحُفٍ مُّکَرَّمَۃٍ ﴿ۙ۱۴﴾", "en": "On honoured sheets.", "w": ["on", "sheets", "honoured", ""]}, {"n": 15, "ar": "مَّرۡفُوۡعَۃٍ مُّطَہَّرَۃٍۭ ﴿ۙ۱۵﴾", "en": "Exalted, purified,", "w": ["exalted", "purified", ""]}, {"n": 16, "ar": "بِاَیۡدِیۡ سَفَرَۃٍ ﴿ۙ۱۶﴾", "en": "In the hands of writers,", "w": ["in the hands", "of writers", ""]}, {"n": 17, "ar": "کِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَۃٍ ﴿ؕ۱۷﴾", "en": "Noble <i>and</i> virtuous.", "w": ["noble", "<i>and</i> virtuous", ""]}, {"n": 18, "ar": "قُتِلَ الۡاِنۡسَانُ مَاۤ اَکۡفَرَہٗ ﴿ؕ۱۸﴾", "en": "Ruin seize the man! how ungrateful he is!", "w": ["ruin seize", "the man", "how", "ungrateful he is", ""]}, {"n": 19, "ar": "مِنۡ اَیِّ شَیۡءٍ خَلَقَہٗ ﴿ؕ۱۹﴾", "en": "Of what does He create him?", "w": ["of", "what", "thing", "does He create him", ""]}, {"n": 20, "ar": "مِنۡ نُّطۡفَۃٍ ؕ خَلَقَہٗ فَقَدَّرَہٗ ﴿ۙ۲۰﴾", "en": "Of a sperm-drop! He creates him and proportions him;", "w": ["of", "a sperm-drop", "", "He creates him", "and proportions him", ""]}, {"n": 21, "ar": "ثُمَّ السَّبِیۡلَ یَسَّرَہٗ ﴿ۙ۲۱﴾", "en": "Then He makes the Way easy for him,", "w": ["then", "the Way", "He makes easy for him", ""]}, {"n": 22, "ar": "ثُمَّ اَمَاتَہٗ فَاَقۡبَرَہٗ ﴿ۙ۲۲﴾", "en": "Then He causes him to die and assigns a grave to him;", "w": ["then", "He causes him to die", "and assigns a grave to him", ""]}, {"n": 23, "ar": "ثُمَّ اِذَا شَآءَ اَنۡشَرَہٗ ﴿ؕ۲۳﴾", "en": "Then, when He pleases, He will raise him up again.", "w": ["then", "when", "He pleases", "He will raise him up again", ""]}, {"n": 24, "ar": "کَلَّا لَمَّا یَقۡضِ مَاۤ اَمَرَہٗ ﴿ؕ۲۴﴾", "en": "Nay! he has not yet done what He commanded him <i>to do</i>.", "w": ["nay", "not", "he has yet done", "what", "He commanded him <i>to do</i>", ""]}, {"n": 25, "ar": "فَلۡیَنۡظُرِ الۡاِنۡسَانُ اِلٰی طَعَامِہٖۤ ﴿ۙ۲۵﴾", "en": "Now let man look at his food:", "w": ["now let look", "man", "at", "his food", ""]}, {"n": 26, "ar": "اَنَّا صَبَبۡنَا الۡمَآءَ صَبًّا ﴿ۙ۲۶﴾", "en": "How We pour down water in abundance,", "w": ["how We", "pour down", "water", "in abundance", ""]}, {"n": 27, "ar": "ثُمَّ شَقَقۡنَا الۡاَرۡضَ شَقًّا ﴿ۙ۲۷﴾", "en": "Then We cleave the earth — a proper cleaving —", "w": ["then", "We cleave", "the earth", "a proper cleaving", ""]}, {"n": 28, "ar": "فَاَنۡۢبَتۡنَا فِیۡہَا حَبًّا ﴿ۙ۲۸﴾", "en": "Then We cause to grow therein grain,", "w": ["then We cause to grow", "therein", "grain", ""]}, {"n": 29, "ar": "وَّعِنَبًا وَّقَضۡبًا ﴿ۙ۲۹﴾", "en": "And grapes and vegetables,", "w": ["and grapes", "and vegetables", ""]}, {"n": 30, "ar": "وَّزَیۡتُوۡنًا وَّنَخۡلًا ﴿ۙ۳۰﴾", "en": "And the olive and the date-palm.", "w": ["and the olive", "and the date-palm", ""]}, {"n": 31, "ar": "وَّحَدَآئِقَ غُلۡبًا ﴿ۙ۳۱﴾", "en": "And walled gardens thickly planted,", "w": ["and walled gardens", "thickly planted", ""]}, {"n": 32, "ar": "وَّفَاکِہَۃً وَّاَبًّا ﴿ۙ۳۲﴾", "en": "And fruits and herbage,", "w": ["and fruits", "and herbage", ""]}, {"n": 33, "ar": "مَّتَاعًا لَّکُمۡ وَلِاَنۡعَامِکُمۡ ﴿ؕ۳۳﴾", "en": "Provision for you and your cattle.", "w": ["provision", "for you", "and your cattle", ""]}, {"n": 34, "ar": "فَاِذَا جَآءَتِ الصَّآخَّۃُ ﴿۫۳۴﴾", "en": "But when the deafening shout comes,", "w": ["but when", "comes", "the deafening shout", ""]}, {"n": 35, "ar": "یَوۡمَ یَفِرُّ الۡمَرۡءُ مِنۡ اَخِیۡہِ ﴿ۙ۳۵﴾", "en": "On the day when a man flees from his brother,", "w": ["on the day when", "flees", "a man", "from", "his brother", ""]}, {"n": 36, "ar": "وَاُمِّہٖ وَاَبِیۡہِ ﴿ۙ۳۶﴾", "en": "And <i>from</i> his mother and his father,", "w": ["and <i>from</i> his mother", "and his father", ""]}, {"n": 37, "ar": "وَصَاحِبَتِہٖ وَبَنِیۡہِ ﴿ؕ۳۷﴾", "en": "And <i>from</i> his wife and his sons,", "w": ["and <i>from</i> his wife", "and his sons", ""]}, {"n": 38, "ar": "لِکُلِّ امۡرِیٴٍ مِّنۡہُمۡ یَوۡمَئِذٍ شَاۡنٌ یُّغۡنِیۡہِ ﴿ؕ۳۸﴾", "en": "Every man among them that day will have concern enough to make him indifferent <i>to others</i>.", "w": ["every", "man", "among them", "that day", "will have concern enough", "to make him indifferent <i>to others</i>", ""]}, {"n": 39, "ar": "وُجُوۡہٌ یَّوۡمَئِذٍ مُّسۡفِرَۃٌ ﴿ۙ۳۹﴾", "en": "On that day some faces will be bright,", "w": ["some faces", "on that day", "will be bright", ""]}, {"n": 40, "ar": "ضَاحِکَۃٌ مُّسۡتَبۡشِرَۃٌ ﴿ۚ۴۰﴾", "en": "Laughing, joyous!", "w": ["laughing", "joyous", ""]}, {"n": 41, "ar": "وَوُجُوۡہٌ یَّوۡمَئِذٍ عَلَیۡہَا غَبَرَۃٌ ﴿ۙ۴۱﴾", "en": "And some faces, on that day, will have dust upon them,", "w": ["and some faces", "on that day", "upon them", "will have dust", ""]}, {"n": 42, "ar": "تَرۡہَقُہَا قَتَرَۃٌ ﴿ؕ۴۲﴾", "en": "Darkness will cover them.", "w": ["will cover them", "darkness", ""]}, {"n": 43, "ar": "اُولٰٓئِکَ ہُمُ الۡکَفَرَۃُ الۡفَجَرَۃُ ﴿٪۴۳﴾", "en": "Those are the ones that disbelieved <i>and</i> were wicked.", "w": ["those", "are the ones that", "disbelieved", "<i>and</i> were wicked", ""]}]}